metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 153: a ROULETTE DISC of King Boo's table (rulet00): the small CENTRE disc (its face is the lowest tier; the pond in its middle). It spins when King Boo hides (or at InitialRollSpeed on its own), carries Mario, and stops when he GROUND-POUNDS the glowing switch pad on its face. Its collision is built from the model at start (AutoCollision). The three sit at one height: KingBooArena.tscn has them placed."

